[statement]
As `a-requested-name-with-one-candidate-is-settled-first`, with `p3` also
providing `y`, at no version and without a priority: `p3` cannot be chosen
for `y`, but counts as a candidate, so `y` is not settled first; `x` is
decided first, for `p1`, and `y` then needs `p2`.

[repository]
P:p1
V:1
p:x
k:100

P:p2
V:1
p:x y
k:10

P:p3
V:1
p:y

[request]
x
y

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1
install p2 1
